                        "entry_id": "41f8dc62-3aec-32c2-aed1-f806c2dc0d73",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The ordinary citizens of an ancient Greek city-state; hence, the common populace of a state or district (especially a democratic one); the people."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
